      },
      "text": "Controls sit between the occupant's comfort preference and the mechanical equipment.\nThe interface has evolved from a bimetal spring to machine-learning algorithms. But the\nunderlying control architecture — 24VAC signaling in residential, BAS/DDC in commercial —\nis fundamentally unchanged for 50+ years."
    },
